{
  "about": "Shared test cases for judging typed answers. The reference matcher (scripts/lib/matcher.mjs) and the game's own matcher must both pass every case. Each case names a test prompt below, an input, and the expected result: accepted (with the answer shown), trap (with the trap's answer), decoy, ambiguous (with the tied answers), unknown or empty. Run: node scripts/check-matcher.mjs. The rules are in docs/content.md.",
